#. module: l10n_sk_vat_return
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_vat_return.field_account_tax__l10n_sk_dph_69_par
msgid ""
"Which row a reverse-charge amount takes on a DPH return for a period before 1. 1. 2021. Only those vzory separate the paragraphs; from 2021 the form merges them and this is ignored.\n"
"\n"
"Left on 'From the supplier's country' — the default, and right for the shared l10n_sk reverse-charge taxes — a line is treated as § 69 ods. 3 when its supplier is established outside Slovakia, which is what that paragraph says. Set it explicitly on a tax a company uses for ONE paragraph only: a dedicated domestic-construction prenos tax is '§ 69 ods. 2 a 9 až 12' whoever the supplier is, and a § 69 ods. 2 goods-with-installation tax is too, even though its supplier is foreign."
msgstr ""

